@host = http://localhost:5000

### Health check
GET {{host}}/health

### Swagger UI
GET {{host}}/api-docs

### Swagger JSON spec
GET {{host}}/api-docs.json

### Upload insurance data file (multipart)
POST {{host}}/api/upload/upload
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary
------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="data-sheet.csv"
< ./test-upload.csv
------WebKitFormBoundary--

### Search policies by username (first name or email)
GET {{host}}/api/policies/search?username=Lura Lucca

### Aggregate policy counts by user
GET {{host}}/api/policies/aggregate/users

### Schedule a message (day = tomorrow, time = HH:mm)
POST {{host}}/api/messages/schedule
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Reminder: policy review due",
  "day": "2026-08-28",
  "time": "14:30"
}

### List scheduled messages
GET {{host}}/api/messages/scheduled

### Cancel a scheduled message (replace :id with a real id)
# DELETE {{host}}/api/messages/scheduled/REPLACE_WITH_ID

### Search policies by username - missing param (expect 400)
GET {{host}}/api/policies/search
